{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17verifyLogoutToken_13configurationAA08VerifiedeF0VSS_AA17OidcConfigurationVtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}],"title":"verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify a back-channel logout token the OP POSTed to this relying party’s own endpoint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§12.7.3)."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key-fetching path.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the discovery issuer; "},{"code":"aud","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" contains this client’s "},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a logout instruction.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"nonce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"absent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At least one of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"type":"text","text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exp"},{"text":" is in the future and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iat"},{"text":" recent.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is present, end that session only."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Falling back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“every session for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"type":"text","text":"” when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"type":"text","text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses to make."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart."}]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/verifylogouttoken(_:configuration:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/VerifiedLogoutToken/jwtID":{"type":"topic","title":"jwtID","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"jwtID","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/verifiedlogouttoken\/jwtid","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"type":"topic","title":"AxiamClient","abstract":[{"text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md).","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/VerifiedLogoutToken/sid":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/verifiedlogouttoken\/sid","title":"sid","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutT